{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46640","headline":"渚宫莫问诗一十五首 十一 · 齐己","name":"渚宫莫问诗一十五首 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫问关门意，从来寡往还。\n道应归淡泊，身合在空闲。\n四面苔围绿，孤窗雨洒斑。\n梦寻何处去，秋色水边山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46640.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46640","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}